# What the CrazyGames build talks to, for the reason .env.android gives at length:
# `.env.local` is read in every mode and a mode file is the one thing that beats
# it, so the zip uploaded to CrazyGames can never carry a developer's localhost.
#
# No secret belongs in here; the address is public and ends up in the bundle.
VITE_API_URL=https://broker-stars-api.broker-stars-worker.workers.dev
